{"availability":"available","full":"pq-code-package/mlkem-native","name":"mlkem-native","description":"Secure, fast, and portable C90 implementation of ML-KEM / FIPS 203","category":"Other","language":"Assembly","stars":247,"forks":69,"created":"2024-03-18T13:21:26Z","updated":"2026-10-12T06:06:08Z","license":null,"branch":"main","homepage":"https://pq-code-package.github.io/mlkem-native/dev/bench/","topics":["cryptography-library","formal-verification","ml-kem","post-quantum-cryptography","post-quantum-kem"],"demo":"https://pq-code-package.github.io/mlkem-native/dev/bench/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T06:27:31.435Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T06:27:31.435Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T06:27:31.435Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-07T02:53:56.318Z","stars":245,"forks":70},{"at":"2026-10-09T03:37:28.057Z","stars":247,"forks":70},{"at":"2026-10-12T06:27:31.435Z","stars":247,"forks":69}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["mlkem-native is a secure, fast, and portable C90[^C90] implementation of ML-KEM[^FIPS203]. It is a fork of the ML-KEM reference implementation[^REF].","All C code in mlkem/src/ and mlkem/src/fips202/ is proved memory-safe (no memory overflow) and type-safe (no integer overflow) using CBMC[^CBMC]. All AArch64 and x8664 assembly is proved to be functionally correct, memory-safe, and of secret-independent timing (constant-time), using HOL-Light[^HOL-Light].","mlkem-native includes native backends for Arm (64-bit, Neon), Intel/AMD (64-bit, AVX2), RISC-V (64-bit, RVV), and POWER (ppc64le, VSX). See benchmarks for performance data."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pq-code-package/mlkem-native/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"eedf3137cf4b1f203854aac5c3d8f051bca814581379076b498961df892d79ce","extractedAt":"2026-10-07T02:53:56.611Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T03:37:28.213Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"mlkem-native is a secure, fast, and portab